  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to the implementation of Mexico&#xbf;s national intelligence and criminal investigations strategy to reduce high-impact crime</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Support to the implementation of Mexico&#xbf;s national intelligence and criminal investigations strategy to reduce high-impact crime - This action will enable the EU to address short and medium-term foreign policy needs and opportunities by supporting innovative policies and initiatives, and by deepening EU relations and dialogues with target communities, forging alliances and partnerships. In particular, this action will support the implementation of Mexico&#xbf;s new national strategy on intelligence and criminal investigations by supporting the implementation of the reform in one priority state with the aim of reducing high-impact crimes and generating replicable experiences for national scale-up; assist European operators (primarily EU SMEs) in complying with EU sanctions while maintaining their competitiveness in international markets.</narrative>
  </description>
